<title>SPAIN: SOCCER-RESULTS IN THE SPANISH CUP THIRD ROUND.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-RESULTS IN THE SPANISH CUP THIRD ROUND.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results in the Spanish Cup, third</p>
<p>round, first leg on Wednesday:</p>
